---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import { SITE, SOURCES, DISCLAIMER } from "../lib/site";
import { TREE } from "../lib/tree";
---
<Base title="About Enshrouded Builder – Sources & Methodology" description="How EnshroudedBuilder.com makes its Enshrouded 1.0 build guides: data sources, how skill orders are checked, licenses and update policy.">
  <article class="wrap pt-14 prose-game max-w-3xl">
    <p class="eyebrow">About</p>
    <h1 class="text-4xl !mt-2">About Enshrouded Builder</h1>
    <p>Enshrouded Builder is a fan-made site with Enshrouded 1.0 build guides and a free skill tree planner. We started it in the first days after the full release because most build guides still had Early Access numbers.</p>
    <h2>Where the data comes from</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Skill tree:</strong> node positions, links, costs, max levels and effect text come from a data export of the 1.0 game files (build {TREE.source.gameBuild}, exported {TREE.source.exportedAtUtc.slice(0, 10)}), published by the open-source <a href={SOURCES.gameData.url} rel="noopener">enshrouded-skill-tree</a> project under GPL-3.0. Build 1267041 is hotfix 1.0.0.1. Hotfix 1.0.0.2 (build 1269579) fixed crashes and skill text translations, and hotfix 1.0.0.3 (build 1273043) fixed crashes and save migration; neither made skill balance changes. Our planner uses this data under the same license, and our source code is public.</li>
      <li><strong>Patch facts:</strong> quoted or summarized from Keen Games' official Steam announcements, including the 1.0 changelog, the "1.0 Combat" preview and the hotfix notes.</li>
      <li><strong>Items, spells and food:</strong> adapted from the <a href={SOURCES.wiki.url} rel="noopener">Enshrouded Wiki</a> on wiki.gg, licensed CC BY-SA 4.0. We only list values that appear on those pages, and we say so when a value predates 1.0.</li>
    </ul>
    <h2>How build guides are checked</h2>
    <p>Each build's skill order is defined as a list of target skills. A script finds the cheapest connected path to each skill through the real tree, and the site build fails if a stage costs more points than a player can have at that level. Tier rankings are editorial opinion and are labeled that way.</p>
    <h2>Art</h2>
    <p>The illustrations on this site are original artwork made for Enshrouded Builder with AI image tools. They are not official game assets or screenshots.</p>
    <h2>Disclaimer</h2>
    <p>{DISCLAIMER}</p>
    <p>Spotted an error? Please tell us on the <a href="/contact/">contact page</a>.</p>
  </article>
</Base>
